<p>First off, this is very well written.</p>
<p>Initially, I wasn't too interested by the concept, but the interviews really caught my attention. The way the story unfolds is very well done.</p>
<p>I do have some questions though, in regards to your spoiler.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;spoilery&nbsp;type&nbsp;questions</a></div>
